<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TTHREE MINERS DIE AT BUFFELSFONTEIN -- TV.</title>
<headline>TTHREE MINERS DIE AT BUFFELSFONTEIN -- TV.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three miners were killed in an earthquake at Buffelsfontein gold mine in South Africa's Northwest Province, state television reported on Thursday.    </p>
<p>Buffelsfontein, managed by Randgold Exploration Company Ltd, produced 1,471 kg of gold in the three months to end-September.</p>
<p>The company was unavailable for immediate comment.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, (27-11) 482-1003 --</p>
